Package: FederatedPs
Title: Plaintext Federated Propensity Scores with Cyclops
Version: 0.0.2
Authors@R: person("Younwoo", "Ki", email = "dewonsunrise@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits a plaintext federated propensity score model with the
    fixed Laplace prior and cyclic coordinate descent used by Cyclops.
    Hospitals retain CohortMethod data locally and exchange coordinate
    statistics through the public pda API.
License: Apache License (== 2.0)
